{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/KenzoKickY.gif?t=1746230977\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26bd\ufe0f <strong>FREE TO PLAY\u00a0</strong>\u26bd\ufe0f <strong>MULTIPLAYER FOOTBALL\u00a0</strong>\u26bd\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>LEGENDARY HEROES</strong> \u26bd\ufe0f  \u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Football Heroes League is a high-octane multiplayer soccer game where superhuman abilities meet precise controls. A real person controls every player on the pitch, creating dynamic matches blending tactics with spectacular special moves. Master the intuitive third-person control system to aim shots, thread perfect passes, and unleash mind-blowing character abilities that defy physics. Team up with friends, show off your skills, and climb the ranks to become a legendary Soccer God!<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/Headers_Eng_SoccerEv.png?t=1746230977\" />Experience soccer reimagined with astounding heroic abilities blended with strategic gameplay for high-stakes competitive matches.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/Screenshots_01.jpg?t=1746230977\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/Headers_Eng_PreciseCon.png?t=1746230977\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/T_BulletItemIcon.png?t=1746230977\" />\u00a0 Master the innovative aiming system to unleash perfect shots and passes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/T_BulletItemIcon.png?t=1746230977\" />\u00a0 Charge your kicks for devastating power plays</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/T_BulletItemIcon.png?t=1746230977\" />\u00a0 Execute advanced moves like juggling, trapping, and precision dribbling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/T_BulletItemIcon.png?t=1746230977\" />\u00a0 Dominate with strategic steals and slide tackles<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/Headers_Eng_LegendHero.png?t=1746230977\" />Choose from a diverse roster of extraordinary characters, with more to come throughout Early Access:<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/HeroCards_Kenzo.jpg?t=1746230977\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/HeroCards_Beckers.jpg?t=1746230977\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/HeroCards_Leo.jpg?t=1746230977\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/HeroCards_Frostine.jpg?t=1746230977\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/HeroCards_BunE.jpg?t=1746230977\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/Headers_Eng_CompProg.png?t=1746230977\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/T_BulletItemIcon.png?t=1746230977\" />\u00a0 Team up with friends in dynamic online matches</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/T_BulletItemIcon.png?t=1746230977\" />\u00a0 Unlock new characters and customize your look</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/T_BulletItemIcon.png?t=1746230977\" />\u00a0 Climb from rookie divisions to legendary Soccer God status</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/T_BulletItemIcon.png?t=1746230977\" />\u00a0 Enjoy skill-based matchmaking for perfectly balanced games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/T_BulletItemIcon.png?t=1746230977\" />\u00a0 Complete daily and weekly quests to earn rewards<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/Screenshots_02.jpg?t=1746230977\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/Headers_Eng_GameModes.png?t=1746230977\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/T_BulletItemIcon.png?t=1746230977\" />\u00a0 Jump into 2v2, 3v3, or 5v5 matches</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/T_BulletItemIcon.png?t=1746230977\" />\u00a0 Train against AI opponents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/T_BulletItemIcon.png?t=1746230977\" />\u00a0 Master abilities in a dedicated Training Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593870/extras/T_BulletItemIcon.png?t=1746230977\" />\u00a0 Coming Soon: Instant Replay System to capture your greatest moments<br><br><br><img class=